{"5140710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BrushHammer Miniature Painter VR", "steam_appid": 5140710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrushHammer Miniature Painter is an innovative mixed-reality experience that lets you live your miniature painting hobby without the mess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more worrying about priming, dried paint pots, or cleanup: just grab a brush and enjoy the hobby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Painting Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras/13e6eb76220ed312603c70e44a58de95.avif?t=1787642290\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras_big/13e6eb76220ed312603c70e44a58de95.webp?t=1787642290 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the perfect game to experiment with your painting ideas. Try new color schemes, techniques, and effects without fear. Undo every mistake, and no miniature gets hurt in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brushes, Spray Cans, Airbrush and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras/2ca11255d9b108ada8cbdcd710b7f19d.avif?t=1787642290\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras_big/2ca11255d9b108ada8cbdcd710b7f19d.avif?t=1787642290 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint virtual miniatures using a robust suite of digital tools. From spray cans and airbrushes to shade washes, edge highlights, dry brushing, decals, high-gloss finishes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So many minis to choose from, and so many more to come!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras/374475966877934ba14f37269ba5a0ec.avif?t=1787642290\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras_big/374475966877934ba14f37269ba5a0ec.avif?t=1787642290 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access original miniature collections crafted by our artists here at Soliton. Each collection includes several models with interchangeable poses, plus various accessories and many basing options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll be able to save years' worth of planning by trying out your paint jobs in-game, before taking your skills back to the real world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrushHammer Miniature Painter is an innovative mixed-reality experience that lets you live your miniature painting hobby without the mess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more worrying about priming, dried paint pots, or cleanup: just grab a brush and enjoy the hobby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Painting Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras/13e6eb76220ed312603c70e44a58de95.avif?t=1787642290\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras_big/13e6eb76220ed312603c70e44a58de95.webp?t=1787642290 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the perfect game to experiment with your painting ideas. Try new color schemes, techniques, and effects without fear. Undo every mistake, and no miniature gets hurt in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brushes, Spray Cans, Airbrush and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras/2ca11255d9b108ada8cbdcd710b7f19d.avif?t=1787642290\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras_big/2ca11255d9b108ada8cbdcd710b7f19d.avif?t=1787642290 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint virtual miniatures using a robust suite of digital tools. From spray cans and airbrushes to shade washes, edge highlights, dry brushing, decals, high-gloss finishes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So many minis to choose from, and so many more to come!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras/374475966877934ba14f37269ba5a0ec.avif?t=1787642290\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/extras_big/374475966877934ba14f37269ba5a0ec.avif?t=1787642290 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access original miniature collections crafted by our artists here at Soliton. Each collection includes several models with interchangeable poses, plus various accessories and many basing options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll be able to save years' worth of planning by trying out your paint jobs in-game, before taking your skills back to the real world.</p>", "short_description": "Pick a mini, grab a brush, and let your imagination run wild! BrushHammer Miniature Painter lets you can paint, customize, and bring awesome miniatures to life. Try crazy colors, add cool effects, and make every mini your own. Mess up? No big deal, just hit undo and try again!", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140710/a7e0be20541a844ab5f2d852b0aebcf014e4b109/header.jpg?t=178764